      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>¡Hola! 👋🏼</p><p>¿Recuerdas el artículo anterior sobre <strong>The “uno minuto” mistake</strong>? Hoy vamos a <strong>corregir los ejercicios</strong> que propuse ayer ✍🏼</p><p>Si no sabes de cuáles estoy hablando, te recomiendo que primero le eches un vistazo al artículo anterior. 👀</p><p>Aquí te dejo el enlace para que puedas revisarlo antes de continuar.</p><p><a href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/publish/post/190422011?">https://dailypushes.substack.com/publish/post/190422011?</a></p><p><em>This post is written in Spanish on purpose. You don’t need to understand every word; just keep reading.</em></p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/acc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg" width="1456" height="1309" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/acc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1309,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:199424,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/i/190514652?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MUxv!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facc56c3a-8339-4db1-a6a0-bc859a66d3ec_1641x1475.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>P.D. Sí, sé que estamos hablando de <em>un, una, uno</em>… y que una ensalada parece completamente fuera de lugar.</p><p>Pero mírala bien. Al final del post te voy a dejar un <strong>mini- reto. </strong></p><p>If you enjoy these posts and would like to keep learning, feel free to subscribe and receive the next one straight to your inbox.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Primero vamos a recordar el truco que compartí en el post anterior para que no se te olvide nunca jamás. </p><h2>💡El truco para no equivocarte nunca más 💡</h2><p>Es muy simple.</p><p><strong>Si acompaña a un sustantivo → UN<br>Si sustituye al sustantivo → UNO</strong></p><p>Ejemplos:</p><p> 🔪<strong>Tengo UN cuchillo</strong><br>🔪 <strong>¿Cuántos cuchillos tienes? — UNO</strong></p><p><strong>Para el femenino no tenemos estos problemas, siempre es UNA</strong></p><p>Ejemplos:</p><p>📺 <strong>Quiero UNA tele</strong><br>📺<strong>¿Cuántas teles quieres? — UNA</strong></p><p></p><h2>Comprobemos los ejercicios (del post anterior)</h2><p><strong>¿Un / Una / Uno?</strong></p><blockquote><p>1. Me das <strong>UN</strong> minuto, por favor.</p><p>2. ¿Cuántos aguacates quieres? — Solo <strong>UNO .</strong></p><p>3. Necesito <strong>UN</strong> momento antes de empezar la reunión.</p><p>4. Me gustan los libros de historia. El otro día compré <strong>UNO</strong> muy interesante.</p><p>5. ¿Cuántas flores tiene tu planta? — Tiene solo <strong>UNA</strong>.</p><p>6. Falta <strong>UN </strong>día para el viaje.</p><p>7. ¿Qué tienes en la mano?  — Tengo <strong>UN</strong> mapa.</p><p>8. ¿Sabes cuantos huecos quedan disponibles? Queda solo <strong>UNO</strong></p><p>9. ¿Cuánto tiempo tienes antes de la próxima clase? — Tengo <strong>UNA</strong> hora.</p><p>10. Voy a pedir <strong>UNA</strong> cerveza.</p></blockquote><p>¿Qué tal te ha ido? </p><p>If you’re still building confidence in Spanish, that’s okay.<br>Little by little. Keep going.</p><p>Do you know someone who’s learning Spanish and might benefit from these articles? Share this with them, and you’ll be doing a triple favour: you help me grow this community, your friend improves their Spanish, and you get to be the cool friend who shares good stuff.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/if-you-say-uno-momento-read-this?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/if-you-say-uno-momento-read-this?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p>Por cierto, igual te estás preguntando qué <em>pinta </em>esa imagen con este texto.  Y la verdad, es que no hay ninguna razón lógica, simplemente me apetecía compartirla. 😋Pero ya que estamos podemos aprovechar para aprender un poco más de español. ¿Sabrías nombrar todos los alimentos que tiene esta deliciosa ensalada? 🥗¿Qué más le añadirías? 🦐¿Le quitarías algún ingrediente? 🫑</p><p> Me encantará leer tus preferencias culinarias en comentarios 😋</p><p>¡Hasta la próxima!</p><p>Ms Myriam</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></content:encoded>
